WEBVTT

00:13:29.721 --> 00:13:31.306
Folks,

00:13:31.348 --> 00:13:35.686
I have an abiding faith in our idealism,

00:13:35.686 --> 00:13:38.647
in mine and in yours. And here’s why.

00:13:39.439 --> 00:13:42.067
Our pursuits may be different,

00:13:42.067 --> 00:13:44.611
our politics may be different,

00:13:44.611 --> 00:13:47.197
our motivations will always be many.

00:13:47.990 --> 00:13:51.910
But our deepest longing
has always been the same:

00:13:52.536 --> 00:13:53.996
to find our humanity,

00:13:54.788 --> 00:14:00.085
to fathom that magnificent vastness
within each of us.